<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87034" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδια-φθείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ruin, destroy beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς ταῖς ἐμβολαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.6.13
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.78
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				22.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>corrupt, demoralize beforehand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς κριτάς</span> prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-</span> in <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγεμόνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.4.11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of milk, <i>go bad beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.88
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
